WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.567 --> 00:00:02.467
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.
This is "Late Night."

00:00:02.467 --> 00:00:03.934
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.934 --> 00:00:05.400
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.400 --> 00:00:07.834
President Biden spoke
from the Oval Office tonight

00:00:07.834 --> 00:00:10.767
in a prime-time address
and asked Congress to approve

00:00:10.767 --> 00:00:13.267
$100 billion in emergency funds.

00:00:13.267 --> 00:00:14.834
Well, good luck with that.

00:00:14.834 --> 00:00:17.534
We can't even get Congress
to approve each other.

00:00:17.534 --> 00:00:19.834
[ Laughter ]

00:00:19.834 --> 00:00:23.200
Republican Congressman
Carlos Gimenez said yesterday

00:00:23.200 --> 00:00:25.667
that his office
has received robocalls

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:28.300
encouraging them to vote
for Ohio Congressman Jim Jordan.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.734
But then he remembered
he actually saved

00:00:30.734 --> 00:00:33.000
Jordan's number as Scam Likely.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:37.868
A group of moderate
Republican lawmakers

00:00:37.868 --> 00:00:40.534
are reportedly pushing
to temporarily empower

00:00:40.534 --> 00:00:43.267
acting House Speaker
pro tem Patrick McHenry.

00:00:43.267 --> 00:00:44.734
Oh, you mean this guy?

00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:45.634
[ Gavel bangs loudly ]

00:00:45.634 --> 00:00:47.300
The...

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:49.367
The congressman from Asgard?

00:00:49.367 --> 00:00:50.934
[ Laughter ]

00:00:50.934 --> 00:00:52.767
Are we sure the lectern
can handle it?

00:00:52.767 --> 00:00:56.367
He slammed that thing like
they just canceled "Fraser."

00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:00.367
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.367 --> 00:01:02.501
Come on.
That dude watches "Fraser."

00:01:02.501 --> 00:01:04.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:04.234 --> 00:01:07.200
While leaving court yesterday,
former President Trump said

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:09.334
that he "probably
won't return this week"

00:01:09.334 --> 00:01:11.234
because of an upcoming
golf tournament

00:01:11.234 --> 00:01:12.868
at his Miami golf club.

00:01:12.868 --> 00:01:14.200
And he doesn't want to miss it

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:15.667
because it's probably
the last time

00:01:15.667 --> 00:01:18.234
it will be considered
his Miami golf club.

00:01:18.234 --> 00:01:20.234
[ Laughter ]

00:01:20.234 --> 00:01:21.801
A man in Kenya
was arrested recently

00:01:21.801 --> 00:01:23.801
for allegedly
impersonating a lawyer

00:01:23.801 --> 00:01:26.133
and winning dozens of lawsuits.

00:01:26.133 --> 00:01:29.400
"I have the exact opposite
problem," said Rudy Giuliani.

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.601
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.601 --> 00:01:34.467
"Maybe I should
stop pretending!"

00:01:34.467 --> 00:01:36.667
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.667 --> 00:01:40.100
In his upcoming biography,
Utah Senator Mitt Romney

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:42.601
criticizes former
Texas Governor Rick Perry

00:01:42.601 --> 00:01:45.200
and says,
"Republicans must realize

00:01:45.200 --> 00:01:48.634
that we have to have someone
who can complete a sentence."

00:01:48.634 --> 00:01:51.000
Responded Perry,
"How dare?"

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:53.267
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.334 --> 00:01:56.934
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.934 --> 00:01:59.300
The drugstore chain
Rite Aid announced yesterday

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:01.801
that it will close
at least 150 stores.

00:02:01.801 --> 00:02:04.601
So the Rite Aid
I was in last week...

00:02:04.601 --> 00:02:07.000
you're telling me
that was open?

00:02:07.000 --> 00:02:10.601
[ Laughter ]

00:02:10.601 --> 00:02:12.200
I should have paid somebody.

00:02:14.467 --> 00:02:16.334
And finally, a couple recently
got married

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:19.133
during the 10-second pit stop
of a NASCAR race.

00:02:19.133 --> 00:02:20.400
And this is embarrassing.

00:02:20.400 --> 00:02:22.400
The honeymoon was even faster.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:26.300
"I swear this never happens!"
[ Laughter ]

00:02:26.300 --> 00:02:27.701
That was a monologue, everybody!

00:02:27.701 --> 00:02:29.634
We're off to the races!
[ Cheers and applause ]

